  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting just energy transition for an inclusive economy in Jordan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Joint Programme (JP) titled #Promoting Just Energy Transition for an inclusive Economy in Jordan# (JET Jordan) aims to support the government, social partners , and society in Jordan with three objectives:  #Policy integration for JET, with focus on energy, agriculture and food manufacturing sectors in the context of energy-water-land nexus, and revision of the Nationally Determined Contributions (NDCs) #Investment plans and green jobs strategy in alignment with the revised NDCs #Entrepreneurs and workers provided with opportunities for JET  The ultimate objective is to provide sound framework conditions for JET to be instigated and accelerated in Jordan.</narrative>
  </description>
